[VOCALIZES] Static.
The signal is bad.
Mavis, are you there?
有静电，信号不好
玛维斯，还在吗？

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:47.912
MAVIS: Yeah, I'm still...
在，我还…

00:02:49.262 --> 00:02:51.873
All right.
I guess he's having fun.
–好吧，我想他玩得挺开心的
–当然了

00:02:52.047 --> 00:02:53.701
Of course he is. [CHUCKLES]
–好吧，我想他玩得挺开心的
–当然了

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.009
GRIFFIN: Wow, I nailed it
with the Sunglasses Man.
我用墨镜侠把玛维斯给唬住了
