00:05:06.486 --> 00:05:08.139
You see, Denisovich?
看到没，丹尼斯维奇？

00:05:08.314 --> 00:05:12.318
This is where I learned
to catch mice and shapeshift.
我就是在这里学会了追老鼠和变形

00:05:12.492 --> 00:05:15.930
And use my incredible
powers and strength.
It's pretty cool. Huh?
