00:06:45.498 --> 00:06:47.674
Help me. Help me. Help me.
帮我，帮我，帮我

00:06:47.848 --> 00:06:50.720
Hokey-pokey.
See ya at the campfire.
好吧，篝火晚会见

00:06:52.505 --> 00:06:53.201
